{"parentUuid":"c7c1f09d-7306-4be5-bc37-2489c50b4926","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"aee3aef4-b80b-42f3-98f5-d0ea691e2835","agentId":"aa2deafc5c0109a11","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016B9wDm3szo4TLvZPouQBJf","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Title: Downloads - RevPi - Industrial Raspberry Pi - Revolution Pi\nURL: https://revolutionpi.com/en/support/downloads#c952\nSource element: <main>\n---\nDownloads\n\nFLYER\n\nDATA SHEETS\n\nOPERATING SYSTEM IMAGES\n\nOverview Image Releases: REVPI TRIXIE | REVPI BOOKWORM\n\nCODESYS: I/O DRIVERS AND CODE EXAMPLES\n\nEU-DECLARATIONS OF CONFORMITY\n\nROHS AND REACH DECLARATIONS\n\nSTEP FILES\n\nSCHEMATICS\n\nGATEWAY DEVICE DESCRIPTION FILES\n\nCODE OF CONDUCT\n\nCan't find what you're looking for?\n\nCheck out our documentation and tutorials for more resources.\n\nFlyer\n\nRevolution Pi Flyer\n\nGeneral Revolution Pi booklet\n\n(5.72 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\nTechnical Data Sheets\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product Series\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product\nOperating System Images\n\n→ Check device compatibility | Image installation instructions\n\nRevPi Trixie 13.0 64-Bit Default\n\nCustomized version of Raspberry Pi OS Trixie 64-bit Default for all current Revolution Pi models.\n\nMD5 Hash (zip archive): f2c2a7e3c29c72a3a089eb082cc5e6e3\n\n(1.23 GB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevPi Trixie 13.0 64-Bit Lite\n\nCustomized version of Raspberry Pi OS Trixie 64-bit Lite for all current Revolution Pi models.\n\nMD5 Hash (zip archive): c365097292ba93c11922b2c414d8192d\n\n(428.49 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRelease Notes\n\nRelease Notes of the latest RevPi Trixie Default and RevPi Trixie Lite Image.\n\n(62.53 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nLicense Terms and Conditions\n\nLicense Terms and Conditions of the latest RevPi Trixie Default and RevPi Trixie Lite Image.\n\n(54.14 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nGPG-Release-Key\n\nRequired for secure image installation\n\nUser-ID: Revolution Pi Archive Signing Key\nValidity: indefinitely\nKey Type/Size: OpenPGP, RSA 4096-Bit\nKey fingerprint: A93A8DB7134D8A5FB9FF9F16A217345D3B70E7CE\n\n(2.44 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\nArchive OS Images\n\nRevPi Bookworm Archive\n\nAccess previous RevPi Bookworm image versions through our download archive.\n\nGO TO ARCHIVE\n\nRevPi Bullseye Archive\n\nAccess previous RevPi Bullseye image versions through our download archive.\n\nGO TO ARCHIVE\n\nRevPi Buster Archive\n\nAccess previous RevPi Buster image versions through our download archive.\n\nGO TO ARCHIVE\n\nRevPi Stretch Archive\n\nAccess previous RevPi Stretch image versions through our download archive.\n\nGO TO ARCHIVE\n\nRevPi Update Tracker\n\nSecurity Patches & Updates via Email\n\nSubscribe to our RevPi Update Tracker and receive an email when software updates for Revolution Pi are available:\n\nProtect your systems: Regular security patches\nNew features & optimizations: New operating system images & updates\nNew CODESYS functions: All driver updates\n\nSUBSCRIBE NOW\n\nCODESYS: I/O Drivers\n\nLatest I/O driver for CODESYS. Please read the release notes included in the download package.\n\nInstructions: Setting up CODESYS on a RevPi\n\nRevPi I/O Driver for CODESYS V3.0.0.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of RevPi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP22 (incl. Release Notes)\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bookworm Image (64 bit) and RevPi Trixie Image (64 Bit)\n\nCompatible with CODESYS Control for Linux ARM (64-bit) V4.18.0.0 and higher\n\n(31.18 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\nCODESYS: Code Examples\n\nCODESYS Code Examples\n\nCollection of CODESYS project examples specifically for Revolution Pi\n\nDOWNLOAD VIA GITLAB\n\nRevPi Update Tracker\n\nDriver Updates and More via Email\n\nSubscribe to our RevPi Update Tracker and receive an email when software updates for Revolution Pi are available:\n\nNew CODESYS functions: All driver updates\nProtect your systems: Regular security patches\nNew features & optimizations: New operating system images & updates\n\nSUBSCRIBE NOW\n\nArchive I/O Drivers\n\nThese I/O drivers for CODESYS are no longer supported. If you need technical support, please update your system with the latest I/O driver.\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V2.5.0.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of Revolution Pi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP21 (Incl. Release Notes)\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bookworm Image (64 bit)\n\nCompatible with CODESYS Control for Linux ARM (64-bit) V4.16.0.0 and higher\n\n(32.29 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V2.4.0.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of Revolution Pi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP21 (Incl. Release Notes)\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bookworm Image (64 bit)\n\nCompatible with CODESYS Control for Linux ARM (64-bit) V4.16.0.0 and higher\n\n(33.81 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V2.3.0.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of Revolution Pi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP21 (Incl. Release Notes)\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bookworm Image (64 bit)\n\nCompatible with CODESYS Control for Linux ARM (64-bit) V4.16.0.0 and higher\n\n(41.44 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V2.2.0.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of Revolution Pi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP21 (Incl. Release Notes)\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bookworm Image (64 bit)\n\n(41.04 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V2.1.0.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of Revolution Pi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP20 (Incl. Release Notes)\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bookworm and RevPi Bullseye\n\n(44.29 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V2.0.0.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of Revolution Pi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP20 (Incl. Release Notes)\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bookworm and RevPi Bullseye\n\n(47.79 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V1.4.2.0\n\nI/O Driver for the Integration of Revolution Pi Devices in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP19 (Incl. Release Notes)\n\nUpwards compatible with CODESYS 3.5 SP21\n\nCompatible with RevPi Bullseye\n\n(40.95 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V1.4.1.0\n\nRevolutionPiBridge V1.4.1.0 driver for the integration of Revolution Pi in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP19.\n\nCompatible with RevPi Buster\n\n(52.88 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V1.4.0.0\n\nRevolutionPiBridge V1.4.0.0 driver for the integration of Revolution Pi in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP19.\n\nCompatible with RevPi Buster\n\n(45.78 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V1.3.0.0\n\nRevolutionPiBridge V1.3.0.0 driver for the integration of Revolution Pi in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP18.\n\nCompatible with RevPi Buster\n\n(47.87 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nRevolution Pi Library for CODESYS V1.2.1.0\n\nRevolutionPiBridge V1.2.1.0 driver for the integration of Revolution Pi in the CODESYS Development System V3.5 SP17.\n\nCompatible with RevPi Buster\n\n(31.58 MB)\nDOWNLOAD\nEU-Declarations of Conformity\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product Series\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product\nRoHS and REACH Declarations\n\nRoHS declaration\n\nRoHS declaration by KUNBUS\n\n(58.69 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nREACH declaration\n\nREACH declaration by KUNBUS\n\n(51.83 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\nSTEP Files\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product Series\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product\nSchematics\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product Series\nRevPi Connect\nRevPi Core\nRevPi Flat\nRevPi expansion modules\nChoose Product\nGateway Device Description Files\n\nPROFIBUS GSD file\n\nPROFIBUS GSD file for RevPi Gate PROFIBUS (item no.: 100069)\n\n(1.37 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nPROFINET XML file\n\nPROFINET XML file for RevPi Gate PROFINET (item no.: 100074)\n\n(10.62 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nEtherNet/IP EDS file\n\nEtherNet/IP EDS file for RevPi Gate EtherNet/IP (item no.: 100066)\n\n(10.03 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\n\nEtherCAT ESI file\n\nEtherCAT ESI file for RevPi Gate EtherCAT (item no.: 100073)\n\n(32.41 KB)\nDOWNLOAD\nCode of Conduct\n\nCode of Conduct\n\nGood collaboration starts with shared values. Our Code of Conduct offers an honest look at the principles that guide the way we do business at KUNBUS.\n\n(2.01 MB)\nDOWNLOAD"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 158347127\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 158347127: \"Downloads - RevPi - Industrial Raspberry Pi - Revolution Pi\" (\"https://revolutionpi.com/en/support/downloads#c952\")"}]}]},"uuid":"fb1cb4ee-f172-43bd-b458-2db6ab0f0b78","timestamp":"2026-10-01T13:43:19.340Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c7c1f09d-7306-4be5-bc37-2489c50b4926","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
